rkshop is open for enrollment from April 1\u20135, 2026. The cohort covers new features and workflows across Cursor (Cloud Agents, Subagents, Glass, MCP, built-in browser), Claude Code (Agent Teams, Cowork, Dispatch, Scheduled Tasks), and Codex (Plugins, Automations), plus tools like Google AI Studio and Google Stitch.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/14df08030220e62ef47b7e378694b3ee?_a=AQAEuop","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"Q8nP2s70f","title":"FAQ for an AI-first web engineering bootcamp","url":"https://flaviocopes.com/is-this-bootcamp-right-for-me","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/is-this-bootcamp-right-for-me-honest-faq--q8np2s70f","summary":"FAQ page for an AI-first Web Engineering Bootcamp by Flavio Copes, addressing common questions about prerequisites (none required), time commitment (1-2 hours/day), format (cohort-based but async-friendly), refund policy (14-day full refund), and access (lifetime). The bootcamp differentiates itself by focusing on building real projects weekly, using AI coding agents from day one, and shipping complete apps rather than isolated exercises. A new cohort starts February 24.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/14df08030220e62ef47b7e378694b3ee?_a=AQAEuop","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-18T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"VcP769O82","title":"Enrollment is open: AI-first Web Engineering Bootcamp (starts Feb 24)","url":"https://flaviocopes.com/enrollment-is-open-ai-first-web-engineering-bootcamp","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/enrollment-is-open-ai-first-web-engineering-bootcamp-starts-feb-24--vcp769o82","summary":"A 10-week AI-first web engineering bootcamp opens for enrollment starting February 24. The program is project-based, beginner-friendly, and designed for async learning with 1-2 hours daily commitment. Pricing ranges from $399 one-time payment to $44/week options, with lifetime access and a 14-day refund policy included.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/14df08030220e62ef47b7e378694b3ee?_a=AQAEuop","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"AseFjvC6c","title":"10 week bootcamp curriculum from portfolio to paid product","url":"https://flaviocopes.com/what-you-will-build-in-10-weeks","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/what-you-will-build-in-10-weeks-from-zero-to-paid-product--asefjvc6c","summary":"A 10-week bootcamp curriculum takes learners from building a portfolio site to launching a paid product with Stripe. The structured path covers interactive JavaScript apps, multi-page sites with SEO, API dashboards, CRUD apps with databases, user authentication, real-time features, admin dashboards, and AI-powered applications. Designed for 1-2 hours daily with async learning and community support through Discord.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/14df08030220e62ef47b7e378694b3ee?_a=AQAEuop","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-16T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"lBsRsUwGM","title":"The skill that matters now: building with AI agents","url":"https://flaviocopes.com/the-skill-that-matters-now-building-with-ai-agents","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-skill-that-matters-now-building-with-ai-agents-lbsrsuwgm","summary":"Working effectively with AI coding agents has become the critical skill for accelerating web development from idea to product. An AI-first bootcamp launching Feb 24 focuses on project-based learning with AI as a coding partner, targeting beginners and developers wanting to update their workflow. The 10-week program emphasizes practical execution over theory memorization.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/14df08030220e62ef47b7e378694b3ee?_a=AQAEunF","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-14T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"RYfAjNH9g","title":"The AI Workshop (Feb 2026 cohort)","url":"https://flaviocopes.com/ai-workshop-feb-2026","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-ai-workshop-feb-2026-cohort--ryfajnh9g","summary":"A cohort-based workshop opens enrollment for February 2026, focusing on AI-powered development tools. The curriculum covers Claude Code features, CLI tools, Git worktrees, MCP integrations, local AI models with Ollama, and various AI coding assistants including Cursor, Zed, and Gemini CLI. Topics include workflows, sandbox environments, Docker integration, subagents, skills, and practical applications like automating commit messages and creating videos with Remotion.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/14df08030220e62ef47b7e378694b3ee?_a=AQAEulh","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-04T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"L0GQoUjbs","title":"The AI Workshop (Jan 2026 cohort)","url":"https://flaviocopes.com/ai-workshop-jan-2026","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-ai-workshop-jan-2026-cohort--l0gqoujbs","summary":"A cohort-based workshop covering AI-powered coding tools and their latest features. Topics include Claude Code, Cursor, new AI models (GPT-5.2, Gemini 3 Flash), code review automation, and practical projects like building a genealogical tree visualizer. The workshop runs from January 1-5, 2026, and focuses on helping developers stay current with rapidly evolving AI tooling without having to track every update themselves.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/14df08030220e62ef47b7e378694b3ee?_a=AQAEulh","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-01-02T05:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"Tgfuy3h0P","title":"The AI Workshop (Dec 2025 cohort)","url":"https://flaviocopes.com/ai-workshop-dec-2025","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-ai-workshop-dec-2025-cohort--tgfuy3h0p","summary":"A monthly workshop program designed to help developers integrate AI coding tools into their workflow. The December 2025 cohort covers various AI models (Gemini 3, GPT 5.1, Composer 1, Opus 4.5), CLI tools (Claude Code, Codex, Warp, OpenCode), IDEs (VS Code with Copilot, Cursor, Google Antigravity), cloud-based vibe coding tools (v0, Bolt, Lovable, Replit), and introduces MCP (Model Context Protocol) integration. Enrollment opens the first 5 days of each month, with content continuously updated to reflect the latest AI developments.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/14df08030220e62ef47b7e378694b3ee?_a=AQAEulh","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-12-01T05:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"zorl2Z0bN","title":"The Valley of Code is back","url":"https://flaviocopes.com/the-valley-of-code-is-back","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-valley-of-code-is-back-zorl2z0bn","summary":"Flavio Copes relaunched The Valley of Code, a learning platform he had previously shut down due to managing too many projects. This time, he's consolidating all 1700+ blog posts from his personal site into The Valley of Code with permanent redirects, planning to reorganize the chronological content into structured lessons over time. His personal blog will now focus only on news and updates, while The Valley of Code becomes his primary resource for coding tutorials and educational content.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/14df08030220e62ef47b7e378694b3ee?_a=AQAEulh","num_upvotes":4,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2025-11-12T05:00:00.000Z"}],"similar_handles":["nodejs","systemdesigncodex","taro","dailydoseofds","crunchydata"],"opposite_handles":["felixrieseberg","tbpn","alexfinn","hamelhusain","ryolu_"],"similar":[{"id":"nodejs","handle":"nodejs","name":"Node.js","is_squad":false,"x":-6.8011,"y":1.766,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":300,"image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/nodejs","features_preview":{"posts_per_week":1.016918,"median_upvotes":1.0